[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
嫉妬に燃える蒼き炎　レヴィアタン[p]
[_tb_end_text]
; @translation
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
燃烧嫉妒的苍蓝之炎　利维坦[p]
[_tb_end_text]
; @end-dialogue



; @dialogue
; @source
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
[ruby text="わざわい"]禍の招き猫　強欲のマモン[p]
[_tb_end_text]
; @translation
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
祸端的招财猫　贪婪的玛门[p]
[_tb_end_text]
